WEBVTT

00:00:01.580 --> 00:00:04.810
<i>If this is a dream, I want to wake up.</i>

00:00:07.430 --> 00:00:10.540
<i>Where am I?</i>

00:00:13.490 --> 00:00:16.800
<i>Was I always able to fight like this?</i>

00:00:18.150 --> 00:00:22.360
<i>I spent all my time sitting in the corner of 
the classroom, fixing and making machines.</i>

00:00:22.770 --> 00:00:25.810
<i>That was my life.</i>

00:00:25.810 --> 00:00:29.530
<i>Now I'm surrounded by a sea of 
flames and a rain of rubble,</i>

00:00:29.530 --> 00:00:32.250
<i>running through clouds of dust.</i>

00:00:34.310 --> 00:00:35.290
<i>I'm scared.</i>

00:00:35.730 --> 00:00:37.480
<i>I don't want to get hurt.</i>

00:00:38.530 --> 00:00:40.940
<i>I just want to spend my afternoons alone,</i>

00:00:41.490 --> 00:00:43.580
<i>fixing old watches and things like that.</i>

00:00:46.370 --> 00:00:48.570
<i>But strangely, when I'm in this world,</i>

00:00:48.980 --> 00:00:52.280
<i>I feel like I have to fight.</i>

00:00:53.320 --> 00:00:55.120
<i>At some point I knew this place,</i>

00:00:55.120 --> 00:00:56.970
<i>and at some point I started fighting.</i>

00:00:57.610 --> 00:00:59.830
<i>At some point, I was here.</i>

00:00:59.830 --> 00:01:01.910
<i>What is this?</i>

00:01:02.960 --> 00:01:04.360
<i>What is this power?</i>

00:01:04.360 --> 00:01:05.830
<i>What is this world?</i>

00:01:06.320 --> 00:01:08.580
<i>What is a Hand Shaker?</i>

00:02:56.680 --> 00:02:57.820
Damn it!

00:02:58.690 --> 00:03:00.600
Why weren't you able to finish them?

00:03:10.530 --> 00:03:11.870
More!

00:03:11.870 --> 00:03:14.840
More! Give me more!

00:03:16.840 --> 00:03:17.840
Okay...

00:03:23.550 --> 00:03:26.470
Don't screw with me, you wimp!

00:03:27.220 --> 00:03:29.290
I should've been able to finish you!

00:03:29.290 --> 00:03:32.290
There's no way you could win!

00:03:36.660 --> 00:03:39.300
Is that your Nimrod?

00:03:39.300 --> 00:03:40.870
Don't make me laugh!

00:03:40.870 --> 00:03:45.740
People like you who just run piss me off!

00:03:46.280 --> 00:03:47.910
Get lost!

00:03:57.240 --> 00:03:58.880
What?

00:04:04.340 --> 00:04:06.470
Do you think you're a Hand Shaker?

00:04:07.880 --> 00:04:10.950
Just let me hunt you!

00:04:13.760 --> 00:04:15.310
Mari!

00:04:15.310 --> 00:04:17.660
Oh, there you are. Sorry.

00:04:17.660 --> 00:04:20.470
So we want guys like that in our club...

00:04:20.470 --> 00:04:23.610
What was the answer to the 
first question on the quiz?

00:04:23.610 --> 00:04:25.120
Alexandria?

00:04:25.120 --> 00:04:26.280
Oh, right!

00:04:35.170 --> 00:04:36.290
You're back?

00:04:38.720 --> 00:04:39.830
Tazuna-kun.

00:04:41.300 --> 00:04:42.730
President Houjou...

00:04:44.540 --> 00:04:46.810
I told you, you can just call me Lily.

00:04:46.810 --> 00:04:48.430
We're in the same grade.

00:04:48.820 --> 00:04:50.070
Sorry.

00:04:50.070 --> 00:04:51.440
Okay, President Lily.

00:04:52.050 --> 00:04:54.760
You were getting into it again, weren't you?

00:05:02.560 --> 00:05:05.120
Once you start concentrating,

00:05:05.120 --> 00:05:08.080
you won't come back just 
because somebody talks to you.

00:05:08.080 --> 00:05:10.160
I was going to play some 
kind of prank on you.

00:05:10.600 --> 00:05:13.780
I know it's a bad habit.

00:05:14.760 --> 00:05:16.260
Here you go.

00:05:18.040 --> 00:05:19.720
You're done already?

00:05:21.080 --> 00:05:21.910
Yeah.

00:05:29.420 --> 00:05:32.420
It's worth answering.

00:05:32.980 --> 00:05:33.910
Come with me!

00:05:33.910 --> 00:05:35.110
He'll send me a message later.

00:05:41.460 --> 00:05:43.880
Yeah, it's fixed!

00:05:43.880 --> 00:05:45.760
Tazuna-kun, thank you!

00:05:48.210 --> 00:05:50.760
President Lily, you're so close...

00:05:52.010 --> 00:05:53.690
I'm sorry.

00:05:56.680 --> 00:05:57.610
Love, huh?

00:05:57.610 --> 00:05:58.640
No!

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:03.940
People always tell me I get too close.

00:06:04.630 --> 00:06:08.270
Maybe it's because I have a little brother.

00:06:08.270 --> 00:06:11.580
You're always so amazing though, Tazuna-kun.

00:06:11.580 --> 00:06:12.750
It wasn't love, huh?

00:06:13.040 --> 00:06:16.450
It was a problem with the 
connection on the charger unit.

00:06:16.450 --> 00:06:18.120
It was easy to fix.

00:06:18.120 --> 00:06:20.480
Anybody in the mechanical 
section could do it.

00:06:20.480 --> 00:06:23.160
No, your craziness for machines is amazing.

00:06:23.480 --> 00:06:25.720
I'll hit you up next time 
I need something fixed.

00:06:26.660 --> 00:06:28.080
But...

00:06:28.080 --> 00:06:29.770
If you can't do this...

00:06:30.480 --> 00:06:32.170
You're really amazing!

00:06:33.170 --> 00:06:35.400
You're the student council 
president, President Hou—

00:06:36.100 --> 00:06:40.540
I mean, President Lily, 
you're a lot more amazing.

00:06:41.340 --> 00:06:45.280
Were you so focused you forgot to eat lunch?

00:06:46.150 --> 00:06:48.390
And I didn't bring a lunchbox today, either.

00:06:48.870 --> 00:06:50.550
When did you start?

00:06:52.960 --> 00:06:54.220
First period.

00:06:56.690 --> 00:06:58.150
I'm hungry.

00:06:58.560 --> 00:07:00.340
I'm sure something good will happen.

00:07:08.150 --> 00:07:08.940
Here.

00:07:10.320 --> 00:07:12.080
The reverse Tower...

00:07:12.430 --> 00:07:15.180
A sudden, unexpected accident.

00:07:19.070 --> 00:07:20.230
That's okay, but...

00:07:22.120 --> 00:07:25.620
How about I buy you a slice of 
cake or something after school,

00:07:25.620 --> 00:07:27.480
as thanks for doing the repair?

00:07:27.480 --> 00:07:28.500
Sorry.

00:07:29.390 --> 00:07:33.110
I have another job to do for 
a professor at the university.

00:07:34.150 --> 00:07:35.460
Sorry...

00:07:35.960 --> 00:07:37.540
I'm doing it because I like it.

00:07:37.540 --> 00:07:39.960
A lot of people ask you for things, right?

00:07:39.960 --> 00:07:44.540
My vice-president said you helped them 
a lot fixing the air conditioner.

00:07:44.840 --> 00:07:47.140
It's good practice for me,

00:07:47.140 --> 00:07:48.870
and I get paid for the parts.

00:07:49.550 --> 00:07:50.860
It meshes!

00:07:53.200 --> 00:07:54.750
I'm really sorry.

00:07:55.050 --> 00:07:56.860
It's okay.

00:07:57.350 --> 00:08:00.260
I'll be tight on time for 
the repair after school,

00:08:00.260 --> 00:08:03.380
so I won't be stopping anywhere 
to fix anything else.

00:08:03.900 --> 00:08:05.260
Right, sorry!

00:08:05.750 --> 00:08:07.350
So cool!

00:08:10.200 --> 00:08:12.090
<i>Makihara-sensei, huh?</i>

00:08:12.630 --> 00:08:14.260
<i>Never met him before.</i>

00:08:14.870 --> 00:08:17.820
<i>I don't really go over to the university.</i>

00:08:31.000 --> 00:08:31.880
Okay.

00:08:33.640 --> 00:08:34.530
I'm done!

00:08:37.540 --> 00:08:39.060
Thanks!

00:08:40.240 --> 00:08:42.250
You really helped me out!

00:08:42.250 --> 00:08:47.130
If you hadn't passed by I don't 
know what I would've done.

00:08:47.130 --> 00:08:48.110
Not at all.

00:08:49.250 --> 00:08:52.610
I glad it all meshed after just a little tuning.

00:08:53.550 --> 00:08:55.710
I have some work to do,

00:08:56.790 --> 00:08:59.220
so if I can pay you back later...

00:08:59.920 --> 00:09:01.880
Aww, you don't need to do that.

00:09:03.060 --> 00:09:05.720
<i>I need to avoid stopping to fix things.</i>

00:09:06.800 --> 00:09:10.460
Sorry, I forgot I was in a hurry!

00:09:11.690 --> 00:09:13.230
Are you okay?

00:09:13.230 --> 00:09:15.910
I'm sorry, it's my fault for being clumsy!

00:09:18.100 --> 00:09:20.310
I'm not okay...

00:09:22.550 --> 00:09:24.620
That's a nice bike.

00:09:24.620 --> 00:09:26.120
I like it.

00:09:26.120 --> 00:09:27.870
Okay, bye!

00:09:27.870 --> 00:09:29.380
Oh, right.

00:09:29.970 --> 00:09:32.030
Really, thanks!

00:09:32.030 --> 00:09:33.590
Thanks, young man!

00:09:34.070 --> 00:09:39.590
And so the one I saw a while 
ago was really good...

00:09:39.590 --> 00:09:45.100
<b>Makihara Labs</b>

00:09:39.590 --> 00:09:45.100
<b><i>It's Makihara!</i></b>

00:09:40.150 --> 00:09:43.180
Um, I'm Takatsuki Tazuna,

00:09:43.180 --> 00:09:45.100
I was asked to fix something here.

00:09:45.830 --> 00:09:48.020
Sorry I'm late.

00:09:48.760 --> 00:09:50.300
Makihara-sensei?

00:09:53.010 --> 00:09:54.480
Sensei?

00:09:54.480 --> 00:09:56.020
Makihara-sensei?

00:09:56.530 --> 00:09:57.940
I'm coming in...

00:09:58.720 --> 00:10:00.440
Did they go somewhere?

00:10:01.080 --> 00:10:03.150
I hope they're not mad.

00:10:03.800 --> 00:10:07.150
I need to fix that habit I have 
of unconsciously fixing things

00:10:07.570 --> 00:10:09.530
when I start focusing...

00:10:15.000 --> 00:10:17.830
This room's got an electronic lock?

00:10:17.830 --> 00:10:20.970
Is there something inside?

00:10:22.210 --> 00:10:23.400
A hospital room?

00:11:44.280 --> 00:11:45.280
Musubu?

00:11:47.350 --> 00:11:48.490
<i>No...</i>

00:11:54.580 --> 00:11:56.620
Brother...

00:11:57.440 --> 00:12:00.380
Don't let go of my hand...

00:12:32.260 --> 00:12:35.140
You who received the Revelation of Babel.

00:12:36.390 --> 00:12:37.940
Wh-Who's there?

00:12:39.250 --> 00:12:43.780
You who will overcome many 
battles and trials...

00:12:47.360 --> 00:12:49.480
You who received the Revelation.

00:12:50.320 --> 00:12:53.580
You who would challenge me.

00:12:54.470 --> 00:12:58.260
Yes, you, the Hand Shaker...

00:13:14.820 --> 00:13:15.960
What was that?

00:13:21.190 --> 00:13:23.210
I finally found you!

00:13:24.480 --> 00:13:27.740
I found you!

00:13:28.640 --> 00:13:30.860
Koyori-kun's partner!

00:13:30.860 --> 00:13:34.390
Welcome Hand Shaker!

00:13:34.390 --> 00:13:36.020
Hand...?

00:13:36.560 --> 00:13:38.240
The Revelation of Babel!

00:13:38.240 --> 00:13:39.400
You received it, right?

00:13:39.400 --> 00:13:41.280
That makes you—

00:13:42.690 --> 00:13:44.400
A-Are you okay?

00:13:46.160 --> 00:13:48.410
Of course I am.

00:13:48.750 --> 00:13:50.630
This isn't meshing.

00:13:50.630 --> 00:13:52.260
Are you Makihara-sensei?

00:13:53.000 --> 00:13:55.420
It doesn't matter if I'm Makihara!

00:13:57.690 --> 00:13:59.060
Um...

00:14:00.550 --> 00:14:02.420
Sorry for just barging in.

00:14:05.510 --> 00:14:08.010
Um, what's a Hand Shaker?

00:14:08.010 --> 00:14:09.430
You'll know if you go!

00:14:10.180 --> 00:14:11.660
G-Go where?

00:14:11.660 --> 00:14:13.800
To the Ziggurat!

00:14:13.800 --> 00:14:15.220
Where is that?

00:14:17.160 --> 00:14:17.800
No.

00:14:18.470 --> 00:14:20.280
You mustn't let go.

00:14:20.280 --> 00:14:21.610
Please don't let go.

00:14:24.340 --> 00:14:26.220
Koyori-kun has awoken.

00:14:26.220 --> 00:14:27.690
And now that she has,

00:14:27.690 --> 00:14:29.450
if you let get of her hand,

00:14:29.450 --> 00:14:32.120
she will die.

00:14:32.120 --> 00:14:33.480
Die?

00:14:43.000 --> 00:14:45.350
Huh? Makihara-sensei?

00:14:48.390 --> 00:14:49.510
What?

00:15:04.110 --> 00:15:05.050
Let's run!

00:15:06.550 --> 00:15:08.060
That was close.

00:15:09.040 --> 00:15:10.020
You can't stand?

00:15:11.970 --> 00:15:13.370
Hang on tight!

00:15:14.110 --> 00:15:15.030
Let's go!

00:15:15.030 --> 00:15:16.200
Damn it!

00:15:16.200 --> 00:15:18.500
What is going on here?

00:15:19.510 --> 00:15:20.680
This is crazy!

00:15:20.680 --> 00:15:22.260
We need to get somewhere...

00:15:22.260 --> 00:15:24.300
But where can we run?

00:15:28.770 --> 00:15:30.330
My body feels so light!

00:15:30.330 --> 00:15:31.510
I can move so fast!

00:15:34.290 --> 00:15:35.850
Damn it, this way!

00:15:43.520 --> 00:15:45.630
We just need to get outside, 
some place with a lot of space.

00:15:45.630 --> 00:15:46.580
The courtyard?

00:15:52.430 --> 00:15:54.150
If we get somewhere with a lot of space,

00:15:55.130 --> 00:15:57.640
we can escape the concentrated attacks!

00:16:05.040 --> 00:16:06.040
Koyori!

00:16:06.040 --> 00:16:09.370
What? You escaped?

00:16:10.580 --> 00:16:12.810
Now, let's do it.

00:16:17.320 --> 00:16:19.590
Did you do this?

00:16:19.590 --> 00:16:21.470
Of course!

00:16:21.470 --> 00:16:24.220
Break Chain! Bind Chain!

00:16:24.220 --> 00:16:25.600
That's us!

00:16:27.250 --> 00:16:28.890
What do you mean?

00:16:32.400 --> 00:16:33.400
Nobody's here?

00:16:36.040 --> 00:16:37.750
Do you know anything?

00:16:37.750 --> 00:16:39.540
What's going on?

00:16:39.540 --> 00:16:40.360
Huh?

00:16:41.430 --> 00:16:43.310
I see! I see!

00:16:45.200 --> 00:16:46.810
You don't have a Nimrod.

00:16:46.810 --> 00:16:48.330
You don't know what the Ziggurat is.

00:16:48.330 --> 00:16:49.920
So that's it.

00:16:50.320 --> 00:16:51.450
Nimrod?

00:16:51.450 --> 00:16:52.820
Ziggurat?

00:16:54.070 --> 00:16:56.100
Where's Makihara-sensei?

00:16:56.100 --> 00:16:57.760
In other words,

00:16:57.760 --> 00:16:59.760
you don't know anything.

00:16:59.760 --> 00:17:02.390
And you're just prey to be hunted.

00:17:11.870 --> 00:17:13.030
Are you okay?

00:17:16.580 --> 00:17:18.830
Now, let's play.

00:17:18.830 --> 00:17:20.760
Do it, Bind!

00:17:22.120 --> 00:17:23.060
Damn it.

00:17:24.120 --> 00:17:26.260
Just keep running.

00:17:26.260 --> 00:17:27.630
Entertain me.

00:17:27.930 --> 00:17:30.140
Being someplace wide-open 
doesn't change anything?

00:17:30.140 --> 00:17:31.620
Someplace with even more space...?

00:17:31.620 --> 00:17:32.730
The sports ground?

00:17:32.730 --> 00:17:34.430
Damn it, that's the other way!

00:17:34.870 --> 00:17:40.070
If I had a shield that could block these 
chains or something, I could escape...

00:17:40.520 --> 00:17:41.430
Damn it!

00:17:41.430 --> 00:17:42.780
Where can I go?

00:17:42.780 --> 00:17:44.110
What do I do?

00:17:57.680 --> 00:18:00.620
Run. He's crazy!

00:18:00.620 --> 00:18:02.010
Crazy?

00:18:02.790 --> 00:18:06.340
Idiot. This is what Hand Shakers do!

00:18:08.740 --> 00:18:10.060
Damn it!

00:18:10.060 --> 00:18:13.370
What? Are you done running?

00:18:14.690 --> 00:18:17.260
I hoped you would entertain 
me a little more...

00:18:19.420 --> 00:18:22.510
Fine. Then I'll hunt you.

00:18:23.920 --> 00:18:24.820
Do it!

00:18:27.620 --> 00:18:28.490
Right!

00:18:31.400 --> 00:18:32.460
Koyori?

00:18:40.360 --> 00:18:41.380
Stop it!

00:18:42.080 --> 00:18:43.180
Stop!

00:18:44.450 --> 00:18:47.300
Don't... Don't let go!

00:18:49.010 --> 00:18:53.640
Brother... don't let go of my hand!

00:18:57.710 --> 00:19:00.020
I said I wouldn't let go!

00:19:01.410 --> 00:19:04.090
You who received the Revelation of Babel.

00:19:05.140 --> 00:19:06.250
<i>What?</i>

00:19:08.530 --> 00:19:09.510
<i>Stars?</i>

00:19:11.680 --> 00:19:12.580
<i>No...</i>

00:19:17.010 --> 00:19:18.000
<i>Gears?</i>

00:19:19.740 --> 00:19:21.240
<i>How many of them are there?</i>

00:19:22.280 --> 00:19:24.020
<i>It's like a planetarium.</i>

00:19:25.660 --> 00:19:27.640
<i>They can sense my feelings?</i>

00:19:27.640 --> 00:19:29.440
You who received the Revelation of Babel.

00:19:29.440 --> 00:19:31.880
<i>They're trying to protect me and Koyori.</i>

00:19:31.880 --> 00:19:33.690
You who would challenge me...

00:19:33.690 --> 00:19:34.990
<i>What is this?</i>

00:19:35.650 --> 00:19:38.950
You are a Hand Shaker.

00:19:39.890 --> 00:19:41.270
Which means...

00:19:42.760 --> 00:19:44.710
they're just like his chains?

00:19:48.240 --> 00:19:49.960
You summoned your Nimrod, huh?

00:19:52.240 --> 00:19:53.360
Well, fine.

00:19:53.360 --> 00:19:57.900
We, Break and Bind, will 
crush your children's toys!

00:20:00.640 --> 00:20:03.480
Come on, what's wrong, Bind?

00:20:03.480 --> 00:20:05.850
More! More!

00:20:05.850 --> 00:20:08.230
You can do it, right?

00:20:18.440 --> 00:20:19.560
Damn it!

00:20:21.490 --> 00:20:23.670
More! More!

00:20:23.670 --> 00:20:25.270
Give me more!

00:20:27.250 --> 00:20:28.270
Okay...

00:20:30.170 --> 00:20:31.660
Hey, Bind.

00:20:32.230 --> 00:20:33.880
Cry in a nice voice.

00:20:35.040 --> 00:20:38.180
Use your chains to finish 
them for real this time.

00:20:38.180 --> 00:20:38.840
Understood?

00:20:38.840 --> 00:20:40.120
Yes...

00:20:40.120 --> 00:20:40.640
Go!

00:20:40.640 --> 00:20:41.930
I'm going!

00:20:41.930 --> 00:20:44.290
Break!

00:20:50.960 --> 00:20:53.030
Don't screw with me, you wimp!

00:20:53.430 --> 00:20:55.560
I should've been able to finish you!

00:20:55.560 --> 00:20:58.670
There's no way you could win!

00:21:07.910 --> 00:21:10.070
Do you think you're a Hand Shaker?

00:21:10.980 --> 00:21:14.920
Just let me hunt you!

00:21:15.920 --> 00:21:18.240
Is that your Nimrod?

00:21:18.240 --> 00:21:19.950
Don't make me laugh!

00:21:19.950 --> 00:21:24.730
People like you who just run piss me off!

00:21:39.880 --> 00:21:41.550
If I can fight with this...

00:21:42.340 --> 00:21:43.450
They're meshing!

00:21:52.850 --> 00:21:54.730
If I can defeat him...

00:22:13.280 --> 00:22:14.150
Let's go.

00:22:19.740 --> 00:22:22.150
So now it's your turn, huh?

00:22:22.150 --> 00:22:23.800
Fine.

00:22:23.800 --> 00:22:25.050
Try it!

00:22:26.920 --> 00:22:27.960
<i>Wow!</i>

00:22:28.520 --> 00:22:30.470
<i>I'm scared, but I'm not scared!</i>

00:22:30.470 --> 00:22:31.540
<i>I can fight!</i>

00:22:32.900 --> 00:22:34.720
<i>I'm not scared...</i>

00:22:34.720 --> 00:22:36.010
<i>I can fight...</i>

00:22:36.010 --> 00:22:39.100
<i>Is it because I'm with Koyori?</i>

00:22:41.560 --> 00:22:42.950
Screw you!

00:22:49.250 --> 00:22:51.980
I won't lose anymore!

00:22:59.460 --> 00:23:01.830
No!

00:23:10.880 --> 00:23:12.170
<i>Thus, the two of them met,</i>

00:23:12.520 --> 00:23:14.790
<i>and the gears of fate began to turn.</i>

00:23:15.170 --> 00:23:18.880
<i>The boy is running on the 
rails and can't go back,</i>

00:23:18.880 --> 00:23:21.320
<i>and the girl is welcomed into a warm place.</i>

00:23:21.650 --> 00:23:25.960
<i>Makihara speaks of the power created 
by the two of them joining hand in hand,</i>

00:23:25.960 --> 00:23:27.380
<i>and the meaning of their battle.</i>

00:23:27.760 --> 00:23:31.180
<i>Can you swear to protect innocent life?</i>

00:23:31.640 --> 00:23:33.990
<i>Next time on Hand Shakers: Episode Two,</i>

00:23:33.990 --> 00:23:35.260
<i>Lead by Red.</i>

00:23:35.700 --> 00:23:38.920
<i>What will Tazuna see where the drops fall?</i>
